    "text": "there."
  },
  {
    "start": 777.66,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Spice on mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 785.06,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "I knew that was coming."
  },
  {
    "start": 789.38,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Put in the bigger pan. Going to be mild"
  },
  {
    "start": 791.22,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "that or not?"
  },
  {
    "start": 797.14,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "The bigger pansexual."
  },
  {
    "start": 799.3,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "That's the one."
  },
  {
    "start": 804.18,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Tell you what."
  },
  {
    "start": 805.34,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Smells nice in here."
  },
  {
    "start": 810.3,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "Smells better than Mickey Robson's"
  },
  {
    "start": 811.62,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "underpants I'll tell you that."
  },
  {
    "start": 816.46,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Thick now ain't it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 818.9,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Nice and white."
  },
  {
    "start": 820.54,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Unless you want your chicken medium rare"
  },
  {
    "start": 821.9,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "like."
  },
  {
    "start": 823.22,
    "duration": 6.48,
    "text": "I'll have it anyway you preference mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 826.62,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "Putting in the food poison."
  },
  {
    "start": 831.98,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "Smell them."
  },
  {
    "start": 834.82,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "Smell them chillies."
  },
  {
    "start": 835.7,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Mhm."
  },
  {
    "start": 836.86,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Straight away out."
  },
  {
    "start": 839.06,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "Change it up in a minute."
  },
  {
    "start": 840.94,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "Onions now in."
  },
  {
    "start": 847.34,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Sauce in there mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 850.86,
    "duration": 5.48,
    "text": "Chinese chicken curry sauce."
  },
  {
    "start": 854.58,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "Aldi special."
  },
  {
    "start": 856.34,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "Smells good like. Kind of what this"
  },
  {
    "start": 861.1,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "And then what I'll do is to get the rest"
  },
  {
    "start": 862.18,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "of the sauce out of here, I'll add a bit"
  },
  {
    "start": 863.26,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "of water in there."
  },
  {
    "start": 864.1,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "I always do that as well."
  },
  {
    "start": 868.7,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "The wind's picking up."
  },
  {
    "start": 869.7,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "It is now."
  },
  {
    "start": 871.5,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "I always said that about 50 times"
  },
  {
    "start": 872.98,
    "duration": 2.16,
    "text": "already, haven't we?"
  },
  {
    "start": 873.9,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "Said it on purpose there, just cuz I"
  },
  {
    "start": 875.14,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "pressed record."
  },
  {
    "start": 875.94,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 877.66,
    "duration": 5.4,
    "text": "Just make it look dramatic."
  },
  {
    "start": 880.18,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "I am some [\u00a0__\u00a0] news outdoors."
  },
  {
    "start": 883.06,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "Look at that, man."
  },
  {
    "start": 884.82,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "Oh, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 899.98,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "Rice."
  },
  {
    "start": 903.98,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "Oh, you forgot that. Get your fair share"
  },
  {
    "start": 905.74,
    "duration": 2.12,
    "text": "on that."
  },
  {
    "start": 906.54,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "I'll get my fair share of that, all"
  },
  {
    "start": 907.86,
    "duration": 2.24,
    "text": "right."
  },
  {
    "start": 910.26,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "You're getting just as much as me."
  },
  {
    "start": 912.62,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Nice."
  },
  {
    "start": 918.82,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Can you do it like this?"
  },
  {
    "start": 926.78,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Loads there, like."
  },
  {
    "start": 928.38,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "I may be saving a bit too much."
  },
  {
    "start": 932.26,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Well, there's our meal, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 934.78,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "I'm having mine out the pot."
  },
  {
    "start": 936.58,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "Mine on the plate, flash."
  },
  {
    "start": 939.66,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Mine flash."
  },
  {
    "start": 941.3,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "What is it then, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 942.62,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "It is Chinese chicken curry with egg"
  },
  {
    "start": 944.7,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "fried rice."
  },
  {
    "start": 946.06,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "What else did you put in?"
  },
  {
    "start": 946.9,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "Put some chilies in and some red onion."
  },
  {
    "start": 949.1,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "Give it a bit more flavor."
  },
  {
    "start": 950.66,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "Like I needed it anyway."
  },
  {
    "start": 951.66,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "Lovely jubbly."
  },
  {
    "start": 961.78,
    "duration": 6.88,
    "text": "Mint off. Not bad for cheap Aldi's meal."
  },
  {
    "start": 965.82,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Done the job like, haven't it?"
  },
  {
    "start": 971.78,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Not cooking out tomorrow, are we?"
  },
  {
    "start": 974.3,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "No, coffee and biscuits in the morning"
  },
  {
    "start": 975.86,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "then."
  },
  {
    "start": 976.66,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Have you got your arm"
  },
  {
    "start": 978.54,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "the thin thing to boil water with?"
  },
  {
    "start": 980.58,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "I think so."
  },
  {
    "start": 981.14,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Pots and pans are all right, Sam. Just"
  },
  {
    "start": 982.98,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "cuz I've used all of these, haven't I?"
  },
  {
    "start": 984.3,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "So,"
  },
  {
    "start": 985.7,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "you're all right."
  },
  {
    "start": 986.78,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "You're absolutely charming."
  },
  {
    "start": 990.02,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Why you fresh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1005.7,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "Chris."
  },
  {
    "start": 1017.78,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Oh, mate. Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 1030.74,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1035.46,
    "duration": 1.24,
    "text": "Another"
  },
  {
    "start": 1035.74,
    "duration": 1.4,
    "text": "Can Ding go now, all right?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1036.7,
    "duration": 1.2,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1037.14,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "Do you want another Can Ding go?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1037.9,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "Yes, please. Cheers, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1039.78,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Cheers."
  },
  {
    "start": 1040.26,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Cheers, Can Ding go."
  },
  {
    "start": 1042.06,
    "duration": 2.08,
    "text": "Nice little whiskey to warm our chest"
  },
  {
    "start": 1043.86,
    "duration": 1.52,
    "text": "up."
  },
  {
    "start": 1044.14,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Chest warmer before bed."
  },
  {
    "start": 1045.38,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "It's just the Bells."
  },
  {
    "start": 1046.42,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Cuz it is cold now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1047.98,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "And the wind's got up a bit."
  },
  {
    "start": 1050.26,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "So, no whiskey of you tonight, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1052.66,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "We've already done a a whiskey review"
  },
  {
    "start": 1054.54,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "before on Bells."
  },
  {
    "start": 1057.58,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "Got a few cans."
  },
  {
    "start": 1059.66,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "There's no point doing the same whiskey"
  },
  {
    "start": 1060.98,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "review again, mate. You know what I"
  },
  {
    "start": 1062.02,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "mean? Unless we're doing the same one."
  },
  {
    "start": 1064.1,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "A theory of later, then you can look"
  },
  {
    "start": 1065.46,
    "duration": 2.56,
    "text": "back."
  },
  {
    "start": 1066.42,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "See if we're just talking shite or not."
  },
  {
    "start": 1068.02,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Yeah. Do you know what I mean?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1070.1,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "All right. This will do the job for us."
  },
  {
    "start": 1072.02,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Chest warmer."
  },
  {
    "start": 1074.02,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "You know it makes sense."
  },
  {
    "start": 1076.06,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Got a few drinks, nice meal, courtesy of"
  },
  {
    "start": 1078.58,
    "duration": 1.88,
    "text": "Chris."
  },
  {
    "start": 1079.1,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "Stuffed off the meal, mate. It's made us"
  },
  {
    "start": 1080.46,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "just feel tired, like. Been class."
  },
  {
    "start": 1083.38,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "And then we're just going to chill out."
  },
  {
    "start": 1085.34,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Listen to a few more tunes. We've got a"
  },
  {
    "start": 1086.82,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "bit of Stone Roses on and that."
  },
  {
    "start": 1088.94,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "And um"
  },
  {
    "start": 1090.82,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "just drift off to the music, yeah?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1092.3,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "All right. Too right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1093.62,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "So, unless anything"
  },
  {
    "start": 1096.38,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "exceptional happens in the next few"
  },
  {
    "start": 1098.46,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "minutes, we will see you Can Ding go"
  },
  {
    "start": 1100.34,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "first thing in the morning."
  },
  {
    "start": 1101.26,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1102.38,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Coffee and biscuit time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1103.54,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Coffee and biscuit time. You know it"
  },
  {
    "start": 1105.06,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "makes sense."
  },
  {
    "start": 1123.34,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "All the Mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 1128.26,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Over here all night."
  },
  {
    "start": 1135.1,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Freezing."
  },
  {
    "start": 1137.22,
    "duration": 3.96,
    "text": "Mind you, I've been nice and warm in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 1138.74,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 1141.86,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "I slept well."
  },
  {
    "start": 1153.5,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "The views are absolutely [\u00a0__\u00a0] out."
  },
  {
    "start": 1181.18,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Only been in the tent 2 minutes."
  },
  {
    "start": 1187.5,
    "duration": 5.72,
    "text": "I'm freezing now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1189.9,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "So, I think I'm going to go back in."
  },
  {
    "start": 1193.58,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Get a coffee on for me and Chris."
  },
  {
    "start": 1199.78,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "And I'll probably look"
  },
  {
    "start": 1201.38,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "getting packed away again."
  },
  {
    "start": 1214.02,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1215.62,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Woke nice and fresh, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 1216.98,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Mhm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1220.1,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "Slept well."
  },
  {
    "start": 1220.9,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "I think that whiskey knocked us for six"
  },
  {
    "start": 1222.5,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "a bit, though."
  },
  {
    "start": 1225.14,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Tony had have bit."
  },
  {
    "start": 1226.31,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Tony had a"
  },
  {
    "start": 1227.62,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "Should dry my mouth and have a little"
  },
  {
    "start": 1228.98,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "sip of water."
  },
  {
    "start": 1261.83,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "All right, folks. While I'm sitting"
  },
  {
    "start": 1263.66,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "finishing me coffee,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1265.62,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "I think I'll mention a couple of"
  },
  {
    "start": 1266.7,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "channels I've been watching lately."
  },
  {
    "start": 1268.38,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "Couple of fantastic channels."
  },
  {
    "start": 1270.46,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "One of them's called On the Fly."
  },
  {
    "start": 1272.62,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "The guy's called Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 1274.35,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "He's a sound bloke."
  },
  {
    "start": 1276.31,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "I asked him for a bit of advice about"
  },
  {
    "start": 1277.62,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "coming here and he he got straight back"
  },
  {
    "start": 1279.35,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "in touch with us. So, thanks for that,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1280.66,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "mate. But, I use channel's mint."
  },
  {
    "start": 1283.18,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "It's pretty new,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1284.7,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "but it's his videos is top quality"
  },
  {
    "start": 1286.35,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "straight away."
  },
  {
    "start": 1287.59,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "He's out camping, hiking, all over the"
  },
  {
    "start": 1289.46,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "place."
  },
  {
    "start": 1290.62,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "You get some fantastic drone footage."
  },
  {
    "start": 1292.94,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "So, um check his channel out. On the"
  },
  {
    "start": 1295.59,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Fly. I'll leave a a link in the"
  },
  {
    "start": 1297.7,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "description to each channel."
  },
  {
    "start": 1299.62,
    "duration": 5.68,
    "text": "Um another channel I've been watching"
  },
  {
    "start": 1301.38,
    "duration": 6.24,
    "text": "quite a bit of is uh Buddha Bushcraft."
  },
  {
    "start": 1305.31,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "Another sound lad, AJ."
  },
  {
    "start": 1307.62,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "Um really nice fellow."
  },
  {
    "start": 1309.74,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "He's he's fairly new to bushcraft, which"
  },
  {
    "start": 1311.51,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "which he tells you, but like he says,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1313.46,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "out in the woods camping and he's he's"
  },
  {
    "start": 1315.59,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "making stuff and um"
  },
  {
    "start": 1317.87,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "I it's just when I watch his channel,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1319.74,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "just you feel relaxed. He's"
  },
  {
    "start": 1321.98,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "just a really nice guy, the way he comes"
  },
  {
    "start": 1323.42,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "across."
  },
  {
    "start": 1324.51,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Anyway, so that's Buddha Bushcraft. I'll"
  },
  {
    "start": 1326.31,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "leave a link in the description"
  },
  {
    "start": 1328.42,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "for that channel as well. Check that one"
  },
  {
    "start": 1329.66,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "out."
  },
  {
    "start": 1330.74,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "Right, guys. We're nearly done now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1332.07,
    "duration": 1.4,
    "text": "Chris is"
  },
  {
    "start": 1332.66,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1333.46,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "almost packed his gear up."
  },
  {
    "start": 1337.38,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "And then we're going to take a walk"
